<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba has no plans regarding Unilever's chemicals.</title>
<headline>Ciba has no plans regarding Unilever's chemicals.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciba Specialty Chemicals, which is being spun off from Novartis AG, said it had no definite plans regarding the possibility of acquiring specialty chemicals operations from Unilever Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no concrete plans,&quot; Ciba Specialty president Rolf Meyer said at a news conference in response to a question.</p>
<p>Earlier this month Anglo-Dutch consumer products group Unilever said it planned to put its specialty chemicals units up for sale in a move aimed at raising up to five billion pounds.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
